    "description": "BEING NORMAL IS BORING...\r\nFed up with the bog-standard dating apps? On FET we're different. We're kinky and unapologetically open. It doesn't matter if you're kink-curious or a BDSM lover, you'll feel welcome in our diverse and inclusive fetish & BDSM dating community. Get ready for BDSM dating with fellow kinksters that's out of this world!\r\n\r\nFIND YOUR FETISH FAMILY\r\nNew to the FET lifestyle or an experienced kinkster? No problem, FET is a safe place to learn and explore BDSM and fetish. Whatever your kink or your fetish, we support and encourage our kinky community to share and learn from each other. On FET, we want everyone to master their kinky lifestyle, so come on in, get kinkd up with us!\r\n\r\n1 IN 3 HAVE A FETISH\r\nFET is the place to uncover more about the BDSM and fetish lifestyle, find munches, fetish parties, BDSM dating and more. You're sure to find tons of like-minded kinksters who share your fetishes. No matter where you are - whether playing in the deepest darkest of dungeons or out and about in your daily life - the FET community is here for you!\r\n\r\nUNLEASH YOUR TRUE SELF\r\nWhip your profile into shape. Upload that selfie and tell kinksters a bit about your kinky self. ;) Safely share your photos and show off your kinky FET lifestyle... \r\n\r\nDISCOVER KINKSTERS LIKE YOU\r\nFinding and keeping in touch with fellow kinksters is easy with our 24/7 newsfeed, free messaging and live chat. If you're looking for that special sub-one, there are kinksters for everyone out there in the Fetish & BDSM dating community - or right here at your fingertips. With just a few taps, start meeting kinksters near you. \r\n\r\nBDSM = SAFETY FIRST ALWAYS\r\nWith great kink comes great responsibility #SSC: For added confidence and a #kinktastic BDSM dating community experience, everyone can verify their profile for free on FET. Having a verified kinkster profile is an excellent way to show other kinksters that you're authentic and not